{"seq":3,"slug":"passive-design-strategies","title":"被动式设计策略与气候适应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/fundamentals-carbon/passive-design-strategies","wordCount":2571,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"被动式设计策略与气候适应\">被动式设计策略与气候适应</h1><p>零碳建筑的第一笔账不该花在光伏板或热泵上，而该花在&quot;让建筑先少用能&quot;上。被动式设计就是那套不依赖运行能耗、靠建筑本体形态与构造去调节冷热光风的手段——朝向、体形、保温、气密、遮阳、蓄热、自然通风。它的价值在碳核算里有个硬逻辑：当电网逐步脱碳、运行碳趋零时，省下的运行能耗边际收益递减，而每一份被动措施带来的负荷削减都是&quot;零运行碳成本&quot;的削减。Passive House Accelerator 给出的实测拆账显示，一座超低能耗的被动房中，全生命周期碳排放里嵌入碳（embodied carbon）占约 77%、运行碳仅占约 23%（<a href=\"https://passivehouseaccelerator.com/articles/embodied-carbon-and-real-world-energy-consumption-in-a-passive-house\">Passive House Accelerator</a>）——这恰恰说明被动式设计要在&quot;削减负荷&quot;与&quot;控制材料碳&quot;之间找平衡，而非单边堆构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>被动式设计的内核是把建筑当作一台不耗电的&quot;气候过滤器&quot;：外界的太阳辐射、温差、风压、湿度被建筑形体与围护结构筛选、延迟、再分配，使室内自然落入人体热舒适区。它与主动式系统（热泵、新风、光伏）的分工是先后关系——被动优先削减需求，主动再去满足残余需求，最后用可再生能源抵消。这条链条决定了被动措施的投资回报最高：它削减的是负荷峰值本身，从而连带缩小后续所有主动设备的容量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[气候与场地输入&lt;br/&gt;太阳辐射 温差 风 湿度] --&gt; B[被动式设计&lt;br/&gt;朝向 体形 保温 气密 遮阳 蓄热 通风]&#10;  B --&gt; C[降低后的供暖供冷照明负荷]&#10;  C --&gt; D[主动式系统&lt;br/&gt;热泵 高效新风带热回收]&#10;  D --&gt; E[残余运行能耗]&#10;  E --&gt; F[可再生能源抵消&lt;br/&gt;光伏 储能]&#10;  F --&gt; G[净零碳运行]&#10;  B --&gt; H[嵌入碳约束&lt;br/&gt;材料选择 循环经济]&#10;  H --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[气候与场地输入&lt;br/&gt;太阳辐射 温差 风 湿度] --&gt; B[被动式设计&lt;br/&gt;朝向 体形 保温 气密 遮阳 蓄热 通风]\n  B --&gt; C[降低后的供暖供冷照明负荷]\n  C --&gt; D[主动式系统&lt;br/&gt;热泵 高效新风带热回收]\n  D --&gt; E[残余运行能耗]\n  E --&gt; F[可再生能源抵消&lt;br/&gt;光伏 储能]\n  F --&gt; G[净零碳运行]\n  B --&gt; H[嵌入碳约束&lt;br/&gt;材料选择 循环经济]\n  H --&gt; G</pre><p>下表对比被动式与主动式两类手段在零碳路径中的角色差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>被动式设计</th>\n<th>主动式系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作用对象</td>\n<td>削减负荷需求本身</td>\n<td>满足残余需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行能耗</td>\n<td>零（不耗电）</td>\n<td>持续耗电</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资回报</td>\n<td>一次投入、全寿命受益</td>\n<td>受设备效率与电价波动影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>极低（无运动部件）</td>\n<td>需检修、更换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在碳账中的位置</td>\n<td>同时影响运行碳与嵌入碳</td>\n<td>主要影响运行碳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型措施</td>\n<td>保温、气密、遮阳、蓄热、自然通风</td>\n<td>热泵、带热回收新风、光伏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"气候分区与生物气候图-先读懂场地再画线\">气候分区与生物气候图：先读懂场地再画线</h2><p>被动策略没有放之四海皆准的版本——同一面南向大窗在严寒地区是宝贵的太阳得热，在湿热地区却是空调灾难。把气候翻译成设计动作的经典工具是 Givoni 生物气候图（Givoni-Milne Bioclimatic Chart）：把当地逐时干球温度与相对湿度点落在焓湿图上，落点所在的区域直接对应该用哪种策略——被动太阳能采暖、高蓄热配夜间通风、自然通风、蒸发冷却、加湿、或不得不上空调除湿（<a href=\"https://aesg.com/perspective/elevating-sustainability-a-conceptual-strategy-for-facade-design-with-givonis-bioclimatic-graph/\">AESG</a>）。</p>\n<p>由此衍生出按气候带分化的策略矩阵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>气候带</th>\n<th>主导矛盾</th>\n<th>优先被动策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>严寒/寒冷</td>\n<td>冬季失热</td>\n<td>厚保温、超低气密、南向集热、紧凑体形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>夏热冬冷</td>\n<td>双向调节</td>\n<td>可调遮阳、适度蓄热、过渡季自然通风</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>夏热冬暖（湿热）</td>\n<td>夏季得热与除湿</td>\n<td>强遮阳、架空通风、浅平面促穿堂风、浅色高反射外表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干热</td>\n<td>昼夜大温差</td>\n<td>高蓄热墙体配夜间通风、小窗深窗、蒸发冷却</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>干热气候里&quot;高蓄热 + 夜间通风&quot;之所以有效，是因为昼夜温差大：白天厚重墙体吸热延迟传入、夜间打开通风把热量带走并给蓄热体充冷。这种把负荷在时间轴上&quot;挪移&quot;的能力，正是被动设计区别于单纯加保温的精妙处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"围护结构-保温-气密与热桥的三位一体\">围护结构：保温、气密与热桥的三位一体</h2><p>把建筑包成一个连续、无缝、无冷热短路的&quot;保温壳&quot;，是所有寒冷气候被动设计的地基。国际被动房标准（Passivhaus）把这件事量化成了可验证的硬指标：年供暖（或供冷）需求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>15</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 15\\ \\mathrm{kWh/(m^2{\\cdot}a)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">kWh/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>，或峰值热负荷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 10\\ \\mathrm{W/m^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">W/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；气密性要求在 50 Pa 压差下换气次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>50</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{50} \\le 0.6\\ \\mathrm{ACH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ACH</span></span></span></span></span></span>，须经现场鼓风门测试在正压与负压两种状态下双向验证（<a href=\"https://passivehouse.com/02_informations/02_passive-house-requirements/02_passive-house-requirements.htm\">Passivhaus Institut</a>）。</p>\n<p>气密性常被误解为&quot;密不透风会闷&quot;——实际上它针对的是无组织渗漏，而新鲜空气由带热回收的机械新风系统受控供给，二者并不矛盾。气密层的连续性可用一条直觉法则检验：&quot;用一支笔能否在剖面图上一笔不断地沿气密层画一整圈&quot;。</p>\n<p>热桥（thermal bridge）是保温壳上的局部短路：阳台挑板、窗框边缘、墙角、穿墙管线处保温不连续，热量沿高导热路径绕过保温层。在超低能耗建筑里，由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 值已压得很低，热桥（线传热系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span>）对总失热的占比反而被放大，绝不可忽略——这是被动房精细化设计的核心难点之一（热桥的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>χ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi/\\chi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span></span></span></span></span> 量化、节点合规计算与无热桥设计详见 <a href=\"../energy-and-systems/high-performance-envelope\">高性能围护结构与超低能耗</a>）。整个流程的依赖关系如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[确定气候带与设计温差] --&gt; B[设定围护结构 U 值目标]&#10;  B --&gt; C[绘制连续气密层路径]&#10;  C --&gt; D[逐节点核算线热桥 psi 值]&#10;  D --&gt; E[PHPP 能量平衡计算]&#10;  E --&gt; F{年需求 ≤ 15 kWh/m2a?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| B&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[鼓风门测试验证 n50 ≤ 0.6]\">graph TD\n  A[确定气候带与设计温差] --&gt; B[设定围护结构 U 值目标]\n  B --&gt; C[绘制连续气密层路径]\n  C --&gt; D[逐节点核算线热桥 psi 值]\n  D --&gt; E[PHPP 能量平衡计算]\n  E --&gt; F{年需求 ≤ 15 kWh/m2a?}\n  F --&gt;|否| B\n  F --&gt;|是| G[鼓风门测试验证 n50 ≤ 0.6]</pre><p>这套计算由被动房规划工具 PHPP（Passive House Planning Package）完成；近年社区还为其开发了 PHribbon 等嵌入碳核算插件，把材料碳一并纳入设计决策（<a href=\"https://www.passivhaustrust.org.uk/competitions_and_campaigns/passivhaus-embodied-carbon/\">Passivhaus Trust</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"太阳得热-遮阳与采光的三方博弈\">太阳得热、遮阳与采光的三方博弈</h2><p>窗户是围护结构里最矛盾的构件：它同时是热损失最大的薄弱点、太阳得热的入口、和自然采光的来源。把这三者调和的关键变量是窗墙比（WWR, window-to-wall ratio）与遮阳的可调性。研究表明，办公建筑的最优窗墙比通常落在 30%–45% 区间，且强依赖朝向与气候；配合遮阳装置时，约 30% 的窗墙比往往能在采光充足与眩光控制间取得较好平衡——合理的窗墙比相比不合理设计可降低建筑能耗 5%–25%（<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1018363916300381\">ScienceDirect</a>、<a href=\"https://coolshadow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Levitt_Beyond-Window-to-Wall-Ratio.pdf\">CoolShadow</a>）。</p>\n<p>遮阳的核心原则是&quot;按太阳高度角分朝向施策&quot;：南向（北半球）夏季太阳高、冬季太阳低，水平挑檐能精准挡夏纳冬；东西向太阳高度低、入射角平，水平板几乎无效，须用竖向百叶或可调外遮阳。气候与太阳分析驱动的朝向优化目标，正是冬季最大化得热、夏季最小化得热，配合恰当尺寸的挑檐与百叶削减晴朗地区的供冷负荷（<a href=\"https://rimkus.com/article/net-zero-architecture/\">Rimkus</a>）。</p>\n<p>采光与得热并非天然对立：进深方向的导光（高侧窗、导光板）能在不增加得热的前提下把天光送往室内深处，从而压低白天的照明用电——而照明负荷的削减又连带减少其散热对夏季供冷的叠加。这种&quot;一个动作牵动多条负荷&quot;的耦合，要求被动设计必须整体寻优，而非逐项孤立调参。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自然通风与蓄热-把负荷在时间和空间里挪走\">自然通风与蓄热：把负荷在时间和空间里挪走</h2><p>不耗电的通风靠两种自然驱动力：风压（迎风面正压、背风面负压形成穿堂风）与热压（烟囱效应——暖空气上升从高处排出、冷空气从低处补入）。烟囱效应在许多气候里足以替代机械供冷（<a href=\"https://rimkus.com/article/net-zero-architecture/\">Rimkus</a>）。其驱动压差随高差与温差增大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta P = \\rho_0 \\cdot g \\cdot h \\cdot \\frac{T_i - T_o}{T_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是进排风口高差、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是室内外温度（开尔文）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是空气密度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 是重力加速度。这解释了为何中庭、通风塔、高侧窗在被动建筑里反复出现——它们都在制造更大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 与更顺畅的热压路径。</p>\n<p>蓄热（thermal mass）则是把负荷沿时间轴搬运的手段：混凝土、石材、砖等重质材料白天吸收并储存热量、夜间缓慢释放，被动地稳定室内温度。蓄热只有在与通风协同时才发挥最大效力——白天蓄热延迟得热、夜间通风为蓄热体充冷，二者构成一个昼夜循环的&quot;热电池&quot;。当昼夜温差不足以靠空气充冷时，相变材料（PCM, phase change material）可在更小体积内提供等效的潜热蓄能（<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2949736126000655\">ScienceDirect</a>）。</p>\n<p>需要警惕的是：蓄热越多、重质材料越多，嵌入碳往往越高。这与本 hub 反复强调的碳账形成直接张力——在运行碳已趋零的超低能耗建筑里，多加一层混凝土蓄热墙削减的运行碳可能远小于它增加的嵌入碳（嵌入碳/隐含碳的核算口径见 <a href=\"../fundamentals-carbon/whole-life-and-embodied-carbon\">全生命周期碳与隐含碳核算</a>，低碳蓄热材料的选择见 <a href=\"../materials-circularity/low-carbon-materials-mass-timber\">低碳材料、低碳水泥与木结构</a>）。参数化研究表明，围护性能、太阳控制与通风策略的协同组合，其节能效果显著优于任何单项措施的叠加（<a href=\"https://www.novatr.com/blog/what-are-net-zero-buildings\">Novatr</a>）——但&quot;协同&quot;必须把嵌入碳作为同一目标函数里的约束项，而不是事后才补的脚注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>被动式设计先于主动系统：它削减负荷需求本身，是零运行碳成本的削减，决定了后续所有主动设备的容量上限。</li>\n<li>在运行碳趋零的超低能耗建筑里，嵌入碳可占全生命周期碳的约 77%（<a href=\"https://passivehouseaccelerator.com/articles/embodied-carbon-and-real-world-energy-consumption-in-a-passive-house\">Passive House Accelerator</a>），被动设计须同时优化负荷与材料碳。</li>\n<li>策略必须按气候带分化：Givoni 生物气候图把逐时温湿度直接翻译成&quot;该用哪种被动手段&quot;。</li>\n<li>围护结构是保温、气密、热桥的三位一体；Passivhaus 量化为年需求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>15</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 15\\ \\mathrm{kWh/(m^2{\\cdot}a)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">kWh/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>50</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{50}\\le 0.6\\ \\mathrm{ACH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ACH</span></span></span></span></span></span>，在低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 值下热桥占比被放大。</li>\n<li>窗是热损、得热、采光的三方博弈；合理窗墙比（多在 30%–45%）配可调遮阳，可降能耗 5%–25%。</li>\n<li>自然通风（风压+热压）与蓄热把负荷在空间与时间上挪移；但蓄热增量须与其嵌入碳代价一并核算，整体寻优而非逐项堆叠。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"被动式设计策略与气候适应","id":"被动式设计策略与气候适应"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"气候分区与生物气候图：先读懂场地再画线","id":"气候分区与生物气候图-先读懂场地再画线"},{"level":2,"text":"围护结构：保温、气密与热桥的三位一体","id":"围护结构-保温-气密与热桥的三位一体"},{"level":2,"text":"太阳得热、遮阳与采光的三方博弈","id":"太阳得热-遮阳与采光的三方博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"自然通风与蓄热：把负荷在时间和空间里挪走","id":"自然通风与蓄热-把负荷在时间和空间里挪走"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"运营碳与建筑能效基准 (Operational Carbon and Energy Benchmarks)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/fundamentals-carbon/operational-carbon-and-energy-benchmarks"},"next":{"title":"高性能围护结构与超低能耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/energy-and-systems/high-performance-envelope"}}